  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "209991c9e0f39822",
      "translationZh": "我是 Tontaube 的联合创始人。我和我的兄弟刚刚发布了 TontaubeV1，这是一款拥有 2.9B 参数的开放权重 TTS 模型，专注于富有表现力的语音、长篇生成以及低延迟本地推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57cac11a899b2882",
      "translationZh": "该模型主要面向英语和德语，支持使用最长一分钟的参考音频进行零样本声音克隆。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8234f92d0d3fc6e",
      "translationZh": "四个独立的自回归模型生成编解码器流，从粗粒度的语义结构逐步细化到声学细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ba114a37ee19d72",
      "translationZh": "对于更高层的码本，模型规模逐步减小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "401c73dbaad3e0e7",
      "translationZh": "字符级文本分词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b52e6c4e185d0db6",
      "translationZh": "对齐的文本与音频共享逻辑位置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63d76942e7995137",
      "translationZh": "通过滚动上下文窗口实现流式生成和实际上不受长度限制的长篇生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecda1b2cfa56aae9",
      "translationZh": "基于 vLLM 的推理，支持跨请求和声学阶段的批处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "018c4f61a22d85f2",
      "translationZh": "在完成预热的 RTX 5090 上，我们测得：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0aba4088df09d1b",
      "translationZh": "单段文本的实时因子（RTF）约为 0.08",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d876314127b717a0",
      "translationZh": "采用批处理时，实时因子（RTF）最低可达 0.02，即速度约为实时的 50 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "775f39ad21535f55",
      "translationZh": "在流式处理路径中，首段编码音频的输出延迟约为 200 ms",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf7143fa041d4d6f",
      "translationZh": "当前版本的低显存和均衡配置要求 GPU 至少具备 24 GB 显存，高吞吐量配置则要求 32 GB 显存。目前显存占用如此之高，是因为采用了 vllm 实现，它支持高并发、低延迟的服务。我们计划发布面向显存更小的 GPU 和设备端使用的量化版本，并提供微调支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf1908bc0cd52a13",
      "translationZh": "我们还开展了一项包含 400 段文本、以大语言模型作为评判者的有声书基准测试。在韵律方面，TontaubeV1 对阵 ElevenLabs Flash v2.5 时得分为 50.1%，并且相比 Fish Audio S2 Pro、Gradium 和 Cartesia Sonic 3 更受偏好。报告中介绍了测试方法、注意事项和置信区间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed3429ffa90b7689",
      "translationZh": "我们知道，真人听音测试仍然是黄金标准。我们未能在发布前开展大规模真人研究，但计划在未来几天通过 TTS Arena V2 和 Artificial Analysis Text to Speech Arena，让真实听众测试 TontaubeV1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4de0383b46b33b55",
      "translationZh": "权重：https://huggingface.co/TontaubeAI/TontaubeV1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef8976003de1fd10",
      "translationZh": "推理代码：https://github.com/craitech/tontaube",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0bcac8499e019a1",
      "translationZh": "技术报告：https://tontaube.ai/papers/tontaube-v1-technical-report.pdf",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b55acb765e6890d6",
      "translationZh": "示例/体验平台：https://tontaube.ai/playground，也可以先在 https://tontaube.ai 免登录体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6944fee229d94b0d",
      "translationZh": "我非常想了解大家独立安装的体验、在其他 GPU 上测得的显存占用，以及你们发现的任何奇怪的失败情况。如果有什么我能帮上忙的地方，请告诉我！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "open-weight",
